+ * pin controller 0x14220000, banks at 0x180 / 0x1A0 (Linux
+ * pinctrl-exynos.c exynos9810_pin_banks3, bank_type_7: CON +0 4 bits, DAT
+ * +4). Bit-banged like the touch bus: CON 1 = output, DAT 0 = line low;
